     1	"""Runtime-owned run envelope.
     2	
     3	This module defines the canonical cross-cutting carrier and the
     4	run-level identity carrier:
     5	
     6	* :class:`RunEnvelope` — frozen cross-cutting metadata (taint, cost,
     7	  lineage, deadline, cancellation, retry-budget, error-class, plus
     8	  lease/fencing/capacity-grant) with a commutative/associative/idempotent
     9	  ``join()`` semilattice, JSON round-trip, and subprocess sidecar
    10	  handshake.
    11	* :class:`RuntimeEnvelope` — the runtime-owned run envelope.  Holds
    12	  plugin identity, manifest hash, schema versions, run id, artifact
    13	  root, resume cursor, trust/quarantine state, creation time, and a
    14	  composed :class:`RunEnvelope`.
    15	
    16	``RunEnvelope`` is the canonical cross-cutting type; ``RuntimeEnvelope``
    17	is the run-level identity carrier.  Both are ``frozen=True`` dataclasses
    18	and round-trip through their respective ``to_json`` / ``from_json``
    19	methods with structural equality.
