   459	@dataclass(frozen=True)
   460	class RuntimeEnvelope:
   461	    """Runtime-owned run envelope.
   462	
   463	    ``schema_version`` is exposed both as an instance field (so the
   464	    persisted envelope carries the version) and as a class-level
   465	    constant (``RuntimeEnvelope.schema_version``) so consumers can pin
   466	    the integer without instantiating.
   467	
   468	    ``trust_state`` defaults to ``"unknown"``; the resume migration
   469	    contract transitions it to a trust label (``"trusted"``,
   470	    ``"quarantined-manifest-mismatch"``, …).
   471	
   472	    The composed ``cross_cutting`` field now holds a full
   473	    :class:`RunEnvelope` (including lease/fencing/capacity-grant
   474	    fields).  The M3 hinge semantics are carried through the
   475	    RunEnvelope semilattice rather than being absent from the
   476	    runtime carrier.
   477	    """
